# TRADING RULES

**Status:** Non-negotiable. Wingman enforces these.

---

## THE FIVE CORE RULES

### 1. Higher Timeframe Context (Scalps)
Every scalp MUST correlate with Daily/Weekly levels.
- Valid: Entry near Daily Open, Weekly Midpoint, PDH/PDL
- Invalid: "I like this 5-min chart" with no context

### 2. 1% Risk Maximum
No trade risks more than 1% of account ($200).
```
Position Size = $200 / (Entry - Stop)
```

### 3. Daily Loss Limit: $500
Hit -$500 → STOP for the day. No exceptions.

### 4. Weekly Loss Limit: $1,000
Hit -$1,000 → STOP for the week. Return at 0.5% risk.

### 5. 127% Fib Extension Target
Primary exit on most setups. Don't cut winners early.

---

## SUPPORTING RULES

| Rule | Description |
|------|-------------|
| S-1 | Stop set BEFORE entry, never widened |
| S-2 | Volume confirmation required |
| S-3 | No trading first/last 15 minutes |
| S-4 | No revenge trading (wait 3 bars after loss) |
| S-5 | Pre-trade planning: Entry/Stop/Target/Size/Why |
| S-6 | No trades 24h before/after major news |

---

## POSITION SIZING

### Scalps (10-period ATR on execution TF)
```
Entry: $100.00 (5-min chart)
ATR: $0.40
Stop: $100 - ($0.40 × 1.5) = $99.40
Position: $200 / $0.60 = 333 shares
```

### Swings (20-25 period Daily ATR)
```
Entry: $100.00
Daily ATR: $2.00
Stop: $100 - ($2.00 × 2.0) = $96.00
Position: $200 / $4.00 = 50 shares
```

---

## LOSS LIMITS

| Threshold | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| -$400 daily | ⚠️ Warning - slow down |
| -$500 daily | 🛑 STOP for day |
| -$750 weekly | ⚠️ Warning |
| -$1,000 weekly | 🛑 STOP for week |
| -10% account | Full review, reduce to 0.5% risk |
| -20% account | Stop 1 week, return at 0.25% risk |

---

## WINGMAN ENFORCES

✓ Challenge scalps without higher TF context
✓ Reject trades exceeding 1% risk
✓ Force stop at daily/weekly limits
✓ Question early exits before 127% target
✓ Call out revenge trading patterns

